Package: easylinux
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, coreutils, findutils, procps
Recommends: kitty, xserver-xorg-input-synaptics
Suggests: snapper, timeshift
Maintainer: hyydra <hyydra@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/hyydra/easylinux
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: One-command Linux desktop and hardware settings with a safety net
 Windows-style Ctrl+C/Ctrl+V (also in the terminal), one global keyboard
 layout, a self-restarting XFCE panel and ThinkPad X280 fixes. Every system
 change is snapshotted first, GRUB is hardened so the boot menu never waits
 forever, and a boot guard rolls changes back if the desktop stops coming up.
 Undo anytime with: sudo easylinux --rollback
